Comment: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:31.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,The distance between us bends all dimensions
Comment: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:35.60,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Calling me, calling me, no transmissions
Comment: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:36.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Say again!
Comment: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:39.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,奪ったり奪われたり　誰の為のREAL?
Comment: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,,上がり下がりまくり　また嫌な夢
Comment: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54}歪む。眩む目を開いて\N{\fs46}(what should I do...)
Comment: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:46.74,OPJP,,0,0,0,,境目surviving　己を裁いてる
