Dialogue: 2,0:22:05.05,0:22:14.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Hey! Buddy
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.40,0:22:16.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.33,0:22:30.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,コンパスに導かれて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ゴールデンコンビ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.00,0:22:33.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らが登場
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.58,0:22:35.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ハイパーマッチ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.04,0:22:36.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,調子は最高潮
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.92,0:22:40.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,以心伝心 一挙公開
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.17,0:22:43.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,鬼神変人 いっちょどーだい？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.42,0:22:46.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,最もBAD でも這い上がる猛獣キッズ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.55,0:22:49.72,EDJP,,0,0,0,,圧倒 What a パワー 込み上げる That's so sick!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.72,0:22:51.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,おかわりちょーだい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.27,0:22:53.06,EDJP,,0,0,0,,華麗にSHOW TIME
Dialogue: 2,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,スマイル豪快
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.60,0:22:55.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らは超た・い・さ・く
Dialogue: 2,0:22:55.90,0:22:58.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Hey! Buddy
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.48,0:22:59.02,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Move on!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! 心踊れ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.40,0:23:05.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! 熱く 高く
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.57,0:23:09.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,メラメラBuddy, Yeah! 炎灯せ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.03,0:23:11.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! Rise up, with you!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.99,0:23:14.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らのストーリー
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,No limit でいけ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.16,0:23:16.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Going Going Going
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.92,0:23:21.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,2人だけの世界抱きしめ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.63,0:23:23.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Burning Burning Burning
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.55,0:23:24.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,未来へ
